{"headword":"נָוָה³","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. pasture, meadow</strong>;—pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:6\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.6\">Zp 2:6</a>, usually <span dir=\"rtl\">נְאוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:2\" href=\"/Psalms.23.2\">ψ 23:2</a> + 11 times;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>pasture, meadow:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ הָרֹעִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:2\" href=\"/Amos.1.2\">Am 1:2</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 2:6\" href=\"/Zephaniah.2.6\">Zp 2:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּדְרוֹת צֹאן</span>; v. also [<a data-ref=\"BDB, כָּרָה\" href=\"/BDB,_כָּרָה\", dir=\"rtl\">כָּרָה</a>] p. 500 supr.); especially <span dir=\"rtl\">נְאוֹת (הַ)מִּדְבָּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.9\">Je 9:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.10\">23:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:13\" href=\"/Psalms.65.13\">ψ 65:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:19\" href=\"/Joel.1.19\">Jo 1:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:20\" href=\"/Joel.1.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:22\" href=\"/Joel.2.22\">2:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ דֶּשֶׁא</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 23:2\" href=\"/Psalms.23.2\">ψ 23:2</a> <em>grassy pastures;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ אֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:13\" href=\"/Psalms.83.13\">ψ 83:13</a> <em>pastures of God</em>, i.e. the land of Canaan, <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ יַעֲקֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 2:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.2.2\">La 2:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ הַשָּׁלוֹם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 25:37\" href=\"/Jeremiah.25.37\">Je 25:37</a> <em>meadows of peace;</em>"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ חָמָס</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:20\" href=\"/Psalms.74.20\">ψ 74:20</a> appar. <em>habitations</em> (?) <em>of violence</em>, but read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּאֲוָה וְח׳</span>, so Bi Che (v. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:6\" href=\"/Psalms.73.6\">73:6</a>).—<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:2\"